	(text "Wio-SX1262 as on the satellite: DIO2 drives the RF switch for TX, RF_SW goes on antenna-enable-gpios\n(high in RX and TX), TCXO 1.8 V on DIO3. R301 holds NSS high while the ESP32 boots.\nL301/C301/C302: pi match footprints, fitted as 0R / not fitted. The stock module brings RF out on its IPEX\n(ANT pad NC): with that variant leave L301 and J301 empty and run the pigtail to a bulkhead SMA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
